    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Specific adaptive hypotheses could relate Fibonacci phyllotaxis to measured fitness components and compare them with developmental null models, but the assertion that these ideas deserve 'no place' is normative. No dataset can directly decide that disciplinary prescription or exclude every possible adaptive role.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-gpt-5.6-sol-medium>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Natural selection's historical contribution is difficult to separate from developmental constraints using extant correlations.", "The conclusion is normative rather than a bounded empirical prediction.";
